Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:54.99,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}想传达给你的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:58.16,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}不可能也是种可能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.79,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}我一直都知道你是谁
